[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  Both \u001b[1mInteractive Clarifying Questions & Parameter Forms (Basic Catalog)\u001b[m and \u001b[1mBidirectional Renderer RPC Functions\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1m(\u001b[94;22mFunctionImplementation\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m have been implemented and verified.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of Changes\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mBidirectional Renderer RPC Functions (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa91e36c968dd604;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart\u0007r\u001b[22menderer_rpc_functions.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\n\u001b[65D\u2022 Implemented \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk764f263ac8a82470;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L47-L60\u0007buildAppA2uiCatalog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka4a8095eca1d5660;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L65-L72\u0007buildRendererRpcFunctions\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, extending \u001b[94mbasicCatalog()\u001b[m with custom A2UI v1.0\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mFunctionImplementation\u001b[ms registered with \u001b[94mAllowedCallers.rendererOrAgent\u001b[m:\r\n\t  \u2022 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk96fd360660bc62"]
[0.0, "o", "72;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L78-L116\u0007GetWorkspaceInfoFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m): Returns a \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4670a69b025aabd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L12-L40\u0007WorkspaceInfoSnapshot\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 map (\u001b[94mprojectId\u001b[m, \u001b[94mprojectName\u001b[m,\r\n\t  \u001b[94mworkingDirectory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mactiveThreadId\u001b[m, \u001b[94mactiveThreadTitle\u001b[m, \u001b[94mthemeMode\u001b[m, \u001b[94msurfaceIds\u001b[m).\r\n\t  \u2022 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5874fd743b1310b6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L123-L197\u0007ListWorkspaceFilesFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m): Safely lists files in the active project's working\r\n\t  directory with optional \u001b[94mextension\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlimit\u001b[m arguments.\r\n\t  \u2022 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc5608c8d5a41fcdb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L204-L243\u0007SetSurfaceDataFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94msetSurfaceData\u001b[m): Mutates any JSO"]
[0.0, "o", "N Pointer \u001b[94mpath\u001b[m in the surface's \u001b[94mDataContext\u001b[m\r\n\t  (\u001b[94mcontext.set(path, value)\u001b[m) for instant local preset/reset \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m \u001b[94maction.functionCall\u001b[ms or agent-triggered\r\n\t  \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m updates.\r\n\t  \u2022 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke49933f179e8793c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L249-L321\u0007FormatParameterSummaryFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m): Reactively formats clarifying form parameters\r\n\t  (\u001b[94mscope\u001b[m, \u001b[94mtarget\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfeatures\u001b[m, \u001b[94mconcurrency\u001b[m, \u001b[94msandboxed\u001b[m) into a live summary string.\r\n\n  2. \u001b[1mInteractive Clarifying Questions & Parameter Forms (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb158c4d23ff9202b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_repository.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5f9f74630a28dd0a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_screen.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\n\u001b[91D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=j"]
[0.0, "o", "k4043f7d8ae24cc75;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L89-L165\u0007ChatRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so \u001b[94ma2uiCatalog\u001b[m and \u001b[94ma2uiPromptSnippet\u001b[m advertise the custom \u001b[94mFunctionImplementation\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cschemas and instruct the agent on emitting A2UI v1.0 clarifying forms and \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m /\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94magentFunctionResponse\u001b[m envelopes.\n\u001b[32D\u2022 Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1001f0a93a7c66a1;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L813-L1038\u0007ChatRepository.buildClarifyingQuestionsReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1f85057dad09b0d8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1043-L1140\u0007ChatRepository.buildWorkspaceRpcReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 along with\r\n\u001b[6Cquick-prompt chips (\u001b[94mClarifying parameter form\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRun workspace RPC function\u001b[m) in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke4269e2168c38ef6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L285-L298\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;"]
[0.0, "o", "\u0007.\n\u001b[92D\u2022 The clarifying parameter form combines \u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m with a \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation check, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mmutuallyExclusive\u001b[m chips and \u001b[94mmultipleSelection\u001b[m checkboxes), \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, a live \u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mText\u001b[m binding,\r\n\n\u28fd  \u001b[90mGenerating..\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
