[2.466, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[30A      \u2022 The clarifying parameter form combines \u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m with a \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation check, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mmutuallyExclusive\u001b[m chips and \u001b[94mmultipleSelection\u001b[m checkboxes), \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, a live \u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mText\u001b[m binding, a \u001b[94mUse Audit Preset\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m invoking \u001b[94msetSurfaceData\u001b[m locally via \u001b[94maction.functionCall\u001b[m, and a \u001b[94mSubmit\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mParameters\u001b[m primary \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m (gated by \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation \u001b[94mchecks\u001b[m) dispatching \u001b[94msubmit_clarifying_parameters\u001b[m with\r\n\u001b[6Cthe resolved parameter context.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mViewModel RPC Wiring (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcd8ff6a163635f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\n\u001b[42D\u2022 Wired \u001b[94moutboundListener\u001b[m on each thread's \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m in\n\u001b[86D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]"]
